**Usage example**
```tsx
<CheckoutPage
  items={cartItems}
  onBackToCart={() => navigate("/cart")}
  onPay={async (address) => {
    await api.submitOrder({ items: cartItems, address });
    navigate("/order-confirmation");
  }}
/>
```

Notes: validation is client-side only (required fields, basic postal/phone format checks) — wire real address/payment validation server-side before production use. The `onPay` prop is async so you can plug in your real payment flow; the button shows a "Processing…" state and disables both buttons while it awaits.
